  "fullDescription": "Editable Weight Loss Planner Bundle Canva Template. Each Template is Editable on Canva so you can change text, colors, fonts, and layout style. Editable Canva Link you can Customize it based on your requirement. You will get High-Quality Print Ready JPG Files and PDF files 8.5×11 Inches.\n\n⭐️ Features & Files Included:\n\n* Belongs To page.\n* Personal Information.\n* My Starting Photo.\n* Body Measurements Chart.\n* Measurement Tracker (52 Week 5 Pages).\n* Why I Want to Lose Weight.\n* 7 Day Challenge.\n* 30 Day Challenge.\n* Weight Loss Tracker\n* 52 Week Weight Logbook.\n* Goals Tracker.\n* Grocery List.\n* Habit Tracker.\n* Sleep Tracker.\n* Measurement Tracker.\n* Daily Measurement Tracker.\n* BMI Tracker.\n* Monthly Measurement Tracker (2 Page).\n* Daily Weight Loss Planner.\n* Diet Journal.\n* Food Diary.\n* Food Tracker.\n* Weight Loss Tracker.\n* Monthly Habit Tracker.\n* Monthly Weight Log.\n* Weekly Meal Planner.\n* Workout Calculator.\n* Weekly Workout Planner.\n* Workout Log.\n* Fitness Reflection.\n* My Ending Photo.\n* My Fitness Notes.\n* Notes.\n\n⭐️ You will get:\n\n* Editable Canva Link\n* High-quality print-ready PDF files\n* JPG Files\n* 40 pages\n* 8.5 X 11 Inches\n* No Bleed\n* CMYK Color\n* 300 PPI\n\n⭐️ What is Canva?\nFree online design software to create anything you want to! The free version is quite powerful, but there is also a Canva Pro version to unlock more functions.\n\n⭐️ HOW TO USE ⭐️\n\n1. Download your file after purchase\n2. Click the link in the PDF\n3. For best results, create an additional copy of the templates to duplicate any pages within the template file.\n4. Use the template over and over again to create multiple printables.\n5. Print your planner with an online printer, a local print shop, or a high-quality home printer.\n\nThis is a digital product. No physical item will be sent to you.\nThank you for your visit!",
